desc:RM1982Delay - ReNo Mellow multi-model multi-tap delay
//@author ReNo Mellow
//@version 1.1
//@changelog 12 classic factory presets: slapback, dotted eighth, vocal throw, ping pong, bucket brigade, dark analog, 80s digital, old radio, doubler, Haas widener, tape runaway, dub (presets do not change Size or color)
//@about
//  # RM1982Delay
//  Multi-model, multi-tap delay: 23 characters from 1940s tape to telephone lines, up to 6 taps.
//  - MODEL, MIX and the ALL TAPS fader (volume of every tap, not the dry signal) are common to all taps.
//  - Default preset: Clean Delay, no feedback ; tap 1 = 1/16 (on), taps 2 to 6 (off) = 1/16 + 20 ms, 1/8, 1/8 + 20 ms, 1/4 + 30 ms, 1/4.
//  - TAPS 1 to 6: click a tap to edit it, double-click (or the ON button) to switch it on / off.
//  - Each tap: INPUT (L, L+R or R), SYNC (off, 1/32 to 1/1, triplets, dotted) + TIME in ms (they add up),
//    FEEDBACK up to 110 %, VINTAGE, LOW CUT, HIGH CUT, MOD (wow / flutter), AGE (saturation, hiss), PAN, VOLUME (taps at -6 dB at 0 dB volume).
//  - VINTAGE on: every repeat goes back through the model colour and the filters (darker, dirtier repeats).
//    VINTAGE off: the colour is applied once to the tap output, repeats stay identical.
//  - TAPE: Lo-Fi Tape, Fat Tape, Gritty Tape, Antique Tape, Classic Tape, Studio Tape, Retro Tape.
//  - ANALOG: Analog Stomp, Fat Bucket, Dark Analog, Soft Delay, Electrostatic, Hose Delay.
//  - DIGITAL: 80s PCM, Gritty PCM, Clean Delay, Chorus Delay 1 / 2 / 3.
//  - LO-FI: Modern Radio, Vintage Radio, Phone Line 1, Phone Line 2.
//  - Drag the knobs (Shift = fine), Ctrl-click = default, mouse wheel. Zero latency.
//  - Click a value (or double-click a knob) to type it: e.g. 1/8d, 250, 1.2s, 3k, off, L30, -6. Enter = OK, Esc = cancel.
//  - Double-click the plug-in name to switch the colour (green / orange).

slider1:15<0,22,1{Lo-Fi Tape,Fat Tape,Gritty Tape,Antique Tape,Classic Tape,Studio Tape,Retro Tape,Analog Stomp,Fat Bucket,Dark Analog,Soft Delay,Electrostatic,Hose Delay,80s PCM,Gritty PCM,Clean Delay,Chorus Delay 1,Chorus Delay 2,Chorus Delay 3,Modern Radio,Vintage Radio,Phone Line 1,Phone Line 2}>-Model
slider2:30<0,100,0.1>-Mix (%)
slider3:0<0,5,1{1,2,3,4,5,6}>-Edited tap
slider4:1<0,4,1{75%,100%,125%,150%,200%}>-Size
slider5:1<0,1,1{Orange,Green}>-Theme (double-click the plug-in name)
slider6:1<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Tap 1 On
slider7:3<0,14,1{OFF,1/32,1/16T,1/16,1/16D,1/8T,1/8,1/8D,1/4T,1/4,1/4D,1/2T,1/2,1/2D,1/1}>-Tap 1 Sync
slider8:0<0,2000,0.1>-Tap 1 Time (ms)
slider9:0<0,110,0.1>-Tap 1 Feedback (%)
slider10:1<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Tap 1 Vintage
slider11:20<20,1000,1>-Tap 1 Low cut (Hz)
slider12:20000<1000,20000,1>-Tap 1 High cut (Hz)
slider13:100<0,200,0.1>-Tap 1 Mod (%)
slider14:100<0,200,0.1>-Tap 1 Age (%)
slider15:0<-100,100,0.1>-Tap 1 Pan
slider16:0<-60,6,0.1>-Tap 1 Volume (dB)
slider17:1<0,2,1{L,L+R,R}>-Tap 1 Input
slider18:0<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Tap 2 On
slider19:3<0,14,1{OFF,1/32,1/16T,1/16,1/16D,1/8T,1/8,1/8D,1/4T,1/4,1/4D,1/2T,1/2,1/2D,1/1}>-Tap 2 Sync
slider20:20<0,2000,0.1>-Tap 2 Time (ms)
slider21:0<0,110,0.1>-Tap 2 Feedback (%)
slider22:1<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Tap 2 Vintage
slider23:20<20,1000,1>-Tap 2 Low cut (Hz)
slider24:20000<1000,20000,1>-Tap 2 High cut (Hz)
slider25:100<0,200,0.1>-Tap 2 Mod (%)
slider26:100<0,200,0.1>-Tap 2 Age (%)
slider27:-50<-100,100,0.1>-Tap 2 Pan
slider28:0<-60,6,0.1>-Tap 2 Volume (dB)
slider29:1<0,2,1{L,L+R,R}>-Tap 2 Input
slider30:0<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Tap 3 On
slider31:6<0,14,1{OFF,1/32,1/16T,1/16,1/16D,1/8T,1/8,1/8D,1/4T,1/4,1/4D,1/2T,1/2,1/2D,1/1}>-Tap 3 Sync
slider32:0<0,2000,0.1>-Tap 3 Time (ms)
slider33:0<0,110,0.1>-Tap 3 Feedback (%)
slider34:1<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Tap 3 Vintage
slider35:20<20,1000,1>-Tap 3 Low cut (Hz)
slider36:20000<1000,20000,1>-Tap 3 High cut (Hz)
slider37:100<0,200,0.1>-Tap 3 Mod (%)
